<title>ROMANIA: Romania December jobless rate flat at 6.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Romania December jobless rate flat at 6.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romania's unemployment rate was 6.1 percent in December, unchanged from the previous month, Labour Ministry data showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Romania's workforce remained constant at 10.491 million.</p>
<p>				 DECEMBER    NOVEMBER  DEC 1995</p>
<p> Number unemployed	 639,177     644,620   998,432</p>
<p> Pct of workforce	    6.1	    6.1	8.9</p>
<p>NOTE -- The ministry said the number of job openings stood at 16,460 last December, down from 16,586 in November. -- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
